pbo-fortran is a modern Fortran translation of the computational
parts of the R package pbo 1.3.5.

Original package:
  pbo: Probability of Backtest Overfitting
  Copyright (c) 2014 Matthew R. Barry
  License: MIT

The original source supplied for this translation is retained unmodified under
original/pbo-1.3.5 and the supplied archive is retained under provenance.
Plotting, R S3 presentation, grid/lattice integration, and foreach parallel
adapters are not compiled into the Fortran library.
